Depends: @SHLIBS@, chloe-common (= @VERSION@)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ForteFibre/chloe
Description: chloe SSH gateway and control plane
 An SSH server that runs coding agents in disposable per-user microVMs.
 Users log in with their GitHub account; API keys and tokens stay outside
 the VM and are substituted by the runner's proxy per destination.
 .
 This package contains chloe-gateway (authentication, workspaces, secrets,
 management commands and API) and its systemd unit.
